  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="9">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAtr">III Atr</ref> 9</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ nan man hryðer ne sléa, buton he habbe twégra trywra manna gewitnesse, ⁊ he healde III niht hyde ⁊ heafod; ⁊ sceapes eallswa.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And no-one shall kill a cow unless he has two trustworthy men as witnesses, and he shall keep the hide and the head for three days; and those of a sheep likewise.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et nemo pecus aliquod occidat, si non habeat duorum credibilium hominum testimonium, et custodiat corium eius tres noctes et caput; et ouis similiter.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
